Z||000000||Rex||05-22-2001||09:14 PM||||For those of you on the forum that have <BR>a V-8 or for that matter any engine in <BR>the 300 HP range my question is....<BR>With good hookup (traction) is the<BR>front end prone to come off the ground?<BR>Even with front engine cars the front end gets light with that kind or power.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Will||05-22-2001||10:38 PM||||All manual transmissions available for the Fiero tend to break when you hook up that hard.<BR>I've never heard anyone here mention Mickey Thompsons or drag radials.||||reg||1
